+/**
+ * The merge gates the direct delivery path (`preMergeGate`) and the delivery
+ * train's member gate (`trainMemberGate`, redesign 2026-10-25 C12) share.
+ * They were extracted unchanged from `hosted-autonomy-spent-delivery.ts`:
+ * `preMergeGate` calls them in its original order, so its behavior is byte
+ * for byte what it was; the train composes the same gates without the base
+ * equality and the moved-base reads.
